msgctxt "256"
msgid "Welcome, sir."
msgstr "Benvenuto, signore."

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Sir, I feel obligated to warn you that there's been an uptick in bag "
"robberies these last few months. Particularly high-end ones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Even some of our customers have had their goods snatched away from them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "They just rob people in broad daylight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Indeed. Apparently there's a syndicate running the streets. One or two "
"members were caught, but crime is still out of control."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"I won't feel safe selling our luxury goods until the whole ring is brought "
"to justice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "(So there's a group of bag snatchers operating in this area...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Please take me seriously on this, sir. And if you happen to purchase "
"something, please be very cautious on your way home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Expensive bags are being snatched right and left lately. It's put quite a "
"dent in our business..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"I hope they catch them soon, but if you buy something in the meantime, be "
"extremely careful on your way home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "On a lighter note, what might you be interested in today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Will that be all, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Of course, sir. Please be careful on your way home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Not just yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Of course. Might I ask what you're looking for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Please come again."
msgstr "Torni pure a trovarci."

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Yeah, I'm done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Very good. Let me show you out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"Thank you for shopping with us. Incidentally⑬is sir perhaps in the market "
"for foreign merchandise?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "You carry that, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Yes, every two months, we order name-brand goods from Europe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"If you make a reservation beforehand, we can track down European goods for "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"They have luxury handbags that aren't yet available in Japan, so if you'd "
"like to get your hands on one, please let us know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"(They can reserve brand-name goods, huh? I should bring this up at the "
"hostess club.)"
msgstr ""

